  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Cities Framework (GrCF): Ulaanbaatar Solid Waste Modernisation Sub-Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Green Cities Framework (GrCF): Ulaanbaatar Solid Waste Modernisation Sub-Project (the Project) will finance priority investments designed to expand landfill capacity and build a Construction and Demolition Waste (CDW) plant for the City of Ulaanbaatar. In addition, the machinery and equipment necessary for the landfill and CDW plant operations will be purchased.</narrative>
  </description>
